{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29692","headline":"赠郑谠处士 · 李商隐","name":"赠郑谠处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浪迹江湖白发新，浮云一片是吾身。\n寒归山观随碁局，暖入汀洲逐钓轮。\n越桂留烹张翰鱠，蜀姜供煮陆机蓴。\n相逢一笑怜疎放，他日扁舟有故人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}